  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: e77cf88fa05d7214886c6453bf1b6c40, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: de55e0833594bf5408f0386e8980cde4, type: 3}
  specialElementNames:
  - Hidden Ant Box
  - Double Ant Box
  - Frozen Ant Box
  - Wall Tile
  - Hidden Tile
  - Hard Tiles
  - Magnetic Box
  - Toggle Box
  - Spawn Tiles
  - Spider Hunter
  - Snake Cutter
  specialElementDescriptions:
  - Reveals itself when moved into the top row
  - Always moves together with its linked partner
  - Can't be selected while frozen. Clear all normal Ant Boxes to unfreeze it
  - Blocks the movement of ants
  - Its color is hidden until it is uncovered
  - Locks a region of tiles. Clear tiles to reduce the counter and break it
  - Selecting one pulls both linked boxes into the waiting slots. Requires 2 adjacent
    slots
  - Toggles open or closed whenever any Ant Box is selected
  - Spawns a fixed-color tile into any empty space when a tile is cleared
  - Spawns hunter ants that defeat the boss spider to clear its webbed tiles
  - A snake blocks paths to tiles, collect special ants to defeat it and clear the
    path
